      "message": "It gets reset along with the whole `pairing_cb` at the end of pairing.\nNew pairing can start only if the `pairing_cb` is not in a busy state. That means only one pairing can happen at a time.\nIf `pairing_cb` is not reset when pairing gets concluded, we would be in a bigger trouble. We used to have issues like that earlier.\n\nBR/EDR bond status in `sec_record` is now updated at the end of pairing. If pairing fails, the bond status would remain \"UNKNOWN\", i.e. not bonded.",
